---
layout: layouts/base.njk
---
<section class="hero">
  <h1 class="hero-title">Lakshmikant Deshpande</h1>
  <p class="hero-role">Staff Software Engineer at PayPal &middot; Bengaluru, India</p>
  <div class="hero-bio">
    <p>I build backend platforms and distributed systems at <strong>PayPal</strong>, focusing on payments, resilience, and high-throughput services. Over the past decade, my work has spanned distributed architectures, APIs, and data pipelines.</p>
    <p>Outside of large-scale systems, I enjoy building small, focused utilities—from Android apps like <em>Clean My Links</em> to developer tools and AI experiments like <em>AutoLLD</em>.</p>
  </div>
  <div class="hero-links">
    <a href="#projects">Projects &darr;</a>
    <a href="#experience">Experience &darr;</a>
    <a href="/about/">More about me &rarr;</a>
    <a href="{{ site.github }}" target="_blank" rel="noopener">GitHub &nearr;</a>
    <a href="{{ site.linkedin }}" target="_blank" rel="noopener">LinkedIn &nearr;</a>
    <a href="mailto:{{ site.email }}">Email &nearr;</a>
  </div>
</section>

<section id="projects" class="section work-section">
  <div class="section-heading">
    <h2>Featured Projects</h2>
    <a class="text-link" href="/work/">View all projects <span aria-hidden="true">&rarr;</span></a>
  </div>
  <div class="project-grid">
    {% for project in collections.projects %}
      {% if project.data.featured %}
        {% include 'project-card.njk' %}
      {% endif %}
    {% endfor %}
  </div>
</section>

<section id="experience" class="section experience-section">
  <div class="section-heading">
    <h2>Experience</h2>
    <a class="text-link" href="/about/">Detailed background <span aria-hidden="true">&rarr;</span></a>
  </div>
  <div class="experience-list">
    <div class="experience-item">
      <div class="experience-meta">
        <span class="experience-company">PayPal</span>
        <span class="experience-period">Staff Software Engineer</span>
      </div>
      <p class="experience-desc">Designing and engineering payment systems, distributed backend infrastructure, and scalable transactional services.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="experience-item">
      <div class="experience-meta">
        <span class="experience-company">AppZen</span>
        <span class="experience-period">Software Engineer</span>
      </div>
      <p class="experience-desc">Built backend services and data workflows for AI-driven financial audit and automated compliance platforms.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="experience-item">
      <div class="experience-meta">
        <span class="experience-company">Clairvoyant</span>
        <span class="experience-period">Software Engineer</span>
      </div>
      <p class="experience-desc">Engineered distributed data pipelines, cloud data platforms, and large-scale data ingestion systems.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="experience-item">
      <div class="experience-meta">
        <span class="experience-company">Persistent Systems</span>
        <span class="experience-period">Software Engineer</span>
      </div>
      <p class="experience-desc">Developed enterprise software, backend services, and APIs across core client systems.</p>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="section writing-section">
  <div class="section-heading">
    <h2>Writing &amp; Notes</h2>
    <a class="text-link" href="/writing/">All writing <span aria-hidden="true">&rarr;</span></a>
  </div>
  <div class="post-list">
    {% for post in collections.posts %}
      {% if loop.index <= 3 %}
        {% include 'post-row.njk' %}
      {% endif %}
    {% else %}
      <div class="writing-empty">
        <p class="empty-heading">Notebook just opened.</p>
        <p>Notes on distributed systems, AI experimentation, and software craft will be published here. Follow along via RSS or check back soon.</p>
        <a class="text-link" href="/feed.xml">Subscribe via RSS <span aria-hidden="true">&nearr;</span></a>
      </div>
    {% endfor %}
  </div>
</section>

<section class="section contact-section">
  <div class="section-heading">
    <h2>Get in Touch</h2>
  </div>
  <div class="contact-box">
    <p>Whether you'd like to talk about backend architectures, small utilities, AI tooling, or just say hello—feel free to drop me a note.</p>
    <div class="contact-methods">
      <a class="contact-link" href="mailto:{{ site.email }}">{{ site.email }} &nearr;</a>
      <a class="contact-link" href="{{ site.linkedin }}" target="_blank" rel="noopener">LinkedIn &nearr;</a>
      <a class="contact-link" href="{{ site.github }}" target="_blank" rel="noopener">GitHub &nearr;</a>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
